	(gr_text "AUDIO\nIM73A135 MEMS mic (diff out)\nU1A diff amp, gain 19.6\nU1B gain 1-16 (RV201)\nAUDIO_OUT at VMID 5.5 V\n1.27 Vpk = +/-75 kHz dev."
