	(gr_text "STACKUP: JLC04161H-7628, 1.6 mm FR-4, HASL\nL1 F.Cu (1 oz): RF + parts, GND pour\n7628 prepreg 0.2104 mm, er 4.4\nL2 In1 (0.5 oz): solid GND plane\nFR-4 core 1.065 mm, er 4.6\nL3 In2 (0.5 oz): DC_Bias | VCC_AUDIO\n7628 prepreg 0.2104 mm, er 4.4\nL4 B.Cu (1 oz): signal + GND pour\n50 ohm = 0.36 mm microstrip, L1 over L2"
